cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Veridex: a hybrid-retrieval, self-verifying knowledge assistant"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
authors:
  - given-names: Swapnil
    alias: Swapnil007-Curious
repository-code: "https://github.com/Swapnil007-Curious/agentic-rag"
url: "https://swapnil007-curious.github.io/agentic-rag/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An independent student research project: a question-answering assistant that searches a fixed,
  inspectable library of open textbooks and Indian statutes before answering, cites the passages
  it uses, checks every sentence against its cited passage, and abstains in Grounded only mode
  when evidence is missing. Retrieval and attached PDFs run in the browser. The repository holds
  the ingestion, retrieval and answering pipelines, their evaluation on held-out test splits with
  paired bootstrap intervals, and the static web app with its rate-limited model proxy.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - hybrid retrieval
  - faithfulness
  - abstention
  - citation verification
